      "rdfs:comment": "The top opening of vessel001, closed by its lid (device:vessel001_lid). Used with the lid off: liquid is poured in, the solids are added, and at the end liquid and solids are poured out. Samples are drawn through the sampling port in the lid instead (port:vessel001_lid_sampling_port)."
    },
    {
      "@id": "port:vessel001_lid_sampling_port",
      "@type": [
        "cpo:DeviceOpening",
        "hlo:Fixed"
      ],
      "rdfs:comment": "Sampling port in the lid of vessel001 (a septum port with a dip tube into the liquid): samples are drawn through it with the reactor closed, under hydrogen. The top opening of the vessel (port:vessel001_opening) is only used with the lid off - filling in and pouring out.",
