      "rdfs:comment": "One container of the inventory, of the kind device:hdpe_container_1L (form, body and opening come from there). The stock of air-dried, knife-milled spruce wood pellets (Picea abies) of the Chemotion collection, sample LCJ-28; LCJ-R5 takes '5g aliquot from SPRUCE-2025-03 stock' from it.",
